        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/e68b1a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-06-12T14:43:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Whether its correct or not, its surely more fun if you let each character play their own copies. &nbsp;If there was some kind of official tournament going on I might be concerned, but playing at home, I'm letting everyone play cards.</p>",
