        "id": 65803,
        "name": "Braithwhite",
        "username": "Braithwhite",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/braithwhite/{size}/1854_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-06-13T14:03:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I ended up making my own decks for Young Legacy and Greatest Legacy, after one too many arguments about the whole Limited card issue, and things that refer to \"Legacy\" applying to all three. &nbsp;</p><p>Besides, It doesn't make any sense for all three Legacy characters to use the same cards! &nbsp;Greatest Legacy didn't have bulletproof skin, and young Legacy doesn't have the wealth of experience her pop brought to the table.</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:43:19.758Z",
